$ swift test --filter EndpointPolicyTests   # after
  ✔ Test run with 5 tests in 1 suite passed after 0.011 seconds.

## 3. the style the fix had to keep
  The first version put run() at 81 lines against swiftlint's 80, and one line in the new test
  file needed breaking. Both were fixed by extracting endpointURL() and breaking the call, not by
  waiving: swiftlint 255 and authored swift-format 747 before this task and after it. The line
  numbers in section 2 were taken before that extraction; the names are what it greps for.
